description=X6886 GSI patch v11.2.5: screen-off FOD unlock fallback - when sys.phh.oplus.fppress is not reported after a screen-off wake, fod_service.sh press() now runs one guarded key-195 capture cycle instead of giving up. Keeps v11.2.4 FOD position config, VoWiFi persistent enable, and ghost touch fixes.
